  3 in 2024\, May 4 in 2025\, Apr 8 in 2026)\, so check early. Hybrid mode
  (2022-2026) and ACM proceedings (2026\; 2024 was IEEE/ACM) are assumed t
 o continue. The students-only poster competition is schedule-only\, like 
 other student-only routes. Size is an editorial estimate.
